export anchor GrungeStyle:
    number: 158
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Grunge
    idea: A 90s grunge magazine page in muted dirt tones, with doubled misregistered type, scratched paper, panels whose ghost frames slip out of line and project rows that refuse to sit straight.
    base: light
    palette:
        paper: #e7e2d7, the scratched page
        card: #efebe2, panels and fields
        ink: #24201b, text, rules and the primary button
        rust: #7d3a1f, ghost frames, the overdue card, Behind and accents
        olive: #4c522c, On track and the second type ghost
        slate: #3f4a55, At risk, asides and the last week line
        dust: #b8ad95, masking tape and the bang icon on ink
        stain: #a99b78, coffee ring blooms in the page, never text
    type:
        Display uses Trebuchet MS, Gill Sans, Gill Sans MT, DejaVu Sans,
        sans-serif, bold lowercase at minus 0.06em, doubled with a rust
        ghost 3px right and an olive ghost 2px left. The greeting is 48 to
        116px at 0.82 line height, numbers 64px, section heads 40px,
        project names 22px. Accents use Times New Roman italic at 0.6 of
        the line, and asides at 14 to 16px. Body, nav and labels use
        American Typewriter, Courier New, Courier, monospace at 13 to 16px
        in lowercase.
    layout:
        A masthead with a tilted lowercase brightwork logo, work in rust,
        beside lowercase typewriter nav with a thick rust underline on
        home, a tilted boxed search, a black new project button with a
        rust offset, a dashed alerts button and the name in italic serif.
        The greeting spans the width in huge lowercase with Mara. in rust
        italic stepped in beneath, the date set vertically at the right,
        and a black slanted strip with a double bang for the overdue line.
        Below, a 260px column and a fluid column. The numbers stack down
        the left in layered boxes nudged sideways by different amounts,
        the overdue one filled rust. The projects panel is a table of
        rows with a big name and italic team, task count and due date,
        a scratchy bar with a ragged clip path end and a percent, and a
        status box, with alternate rows shifted 5 to 8px. Under it, two
        panels, lately with activity on slightly rotated paper strips
        edged in ink, and done per day as a doubled line chart, dashed
        slate for last week and solid ink for this week, each with an
        offset ghost line. Every panel has a 2px rust ghost frame slipped
        7px right and 6px up. Below 960px the columns stack and the
        numbers sit two by two.
    spacing: An 8px base with uneven offsets of 5 to 18px on purpose. Columns of 260px and fluid.
    density: Medium. Big lowercase headings over dense typewriter detail.
    corners: Square. Rough edges come from clip paths on bars and slight rotations.
    borders: A 2px ink box with a 2px rust ghost frame offset behind it. 1px ink row rules.
    shadows: No blur. Hard offset rust or olive slabs behind buttons and swatches. Fractal noise and faint diagonal scratches across the page.
    icons:
        Rough outline strokes. A wobbly ring means on track, a hollow
        bevelled triangle in a dashed box means at risk, a heavy cross on
        rust means behind, and a double bang marks overdue.
    focus: A 2px ink outline offset 2px with a 4px rust slab down right and a 3px olive slab up left.
    tone: Flat, wry and lowercase, such as lately, six give or take nothing and sorted by nothing.
